                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is the first in a long series of Dark Romance games. It's an old-school hidden object game with hand-drawn graphics and journals to help you keep track. I reviewed it 10 years ago on another site and here I am playing it yet again. You get to play two characters, decorate your castle and page, find hidden treasures, and the bonus chapter gives you two alternative endings. This will always stand as one of my favorites.",
